### Generic Sensor Data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/ingest/generic
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: dev-secret

{
  "deviceId": "sensor-01",
  "timestamp": "2026-08-13T10:00:00Z",
  "values": [
    { "metric": "temperature_c", "value": 22.5, "unit": "C" },
    { "metric": "humidity_pct", "value": 65.2, "unit": "%" }
  ]
}
